[0.280, "o", "\u001b[36m╭─\u001b[0m\u001b[36m Memory recalled by Tier 1 SOC Analyst (from IR-2024-117) \u001b[0m\u001b[36m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[36m─╮\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                      \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m  IR-2024-117. Started with a similar alert pattern: svc-reporting account used from a non-standard workstation,      \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m  followed by file server enumeration. Initial hypothesis was credential reuse from a dev environment. Real cause:    \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m  phishing email 9 days prior, attacker had been enumerating since. Lesson: don't dismiss off-hours service account   \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m  anomalies even if a benign explanation seems plausible. Spend the 20 minutes verifying.                             \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m          "]
[0.000, "o", "                                                                                                            \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.460, "o", "\u001b[1;36m╭─\u001b[0m\u001b[1;36m Tier 1 SOC Analyst writes memory \u001b[0m\u001b[1;36m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[1;36m─╮\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;36m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                      \u001b[1;36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;36m│\u001b[0m  IR-2024-184 triage decision: Escalating to Tier 2 at 02:38 AM. Pattern matches IR-2024-117. Team heuristic          \u001b[1;36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;36m│\u001b[0m  confirms escalation.                                                                                                \u001b[1;36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;36m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                      \u001b[1;36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;36m╰─\u001b[0m\u001b[1;36m───────────────────────"]
