[2.503, "o", "\u001b[1;33m                                  SHIFT CHANGE                                  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m╔══════════════════════════╦═════════════════════════╦═════════════════════════╗\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m║\u001b[0m\u001b[1m \u001b[0m\u001b[1mField                   \u001b[0m\u001b[1m \u001b[0m\u001b[33m║\u001b[0m\u001b[1m \u001b[0m\u001b[1mBefore                 \u001b[0m\u001b[1m \u001b[0m\u001b[33m║\u001b[0m\u001b[1m \u001b[0m\u001b[1mAfter                  \u001b[0m\u001b[1m \u001b[0m\u001b[33m║\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m╠══════════════════════════╬═════════════════════════╬═════════════════════════╣\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m║\u001b[0m\u001b[2m \u001b[0m\u001b[2mRole (actor_id)         \u001b[0m\u001b[2m \u001b[0m\u001b[33m║\u001b[0m\u001b[31m \u001b[0m\u001b[31msoc-tier2-analyst      \u001b[0m\u001b[31m \u001b[0m\u001b[33m║\u001b[0m\u001b[32m \u001b[0m\u001b[32msoc-tier2-analyst      \u001b[0m\u001b[32m \u001b[0m\u001b[33m║\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m║\u001b[0m\u001b[2m \u001b[0m\u001b[2mHu"]
[0.000, "o", "man (driver_id)       \u001b[0m\u001b[2m \u001b[0m\u001b[33m║\u001b[0m\u001b[31m \u001b[0m\u001b[31mjason-park             \u001b[0m\u001b[31m \u001b[0m\u001b[33m║\u001b[0m\u001b[32m \u001b[0m\u001b[32mmaya-chen              \u001b[0m\u001b[32m \u001b[0m\u001b[33m║\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m║\u001b[0m\u001b[2m \u001b[0m\u001b[2mShift                   \u001b[0m\u001b[2m \u001b[0m\u001b[33m║\u001b[0m\u001b[31m \u001b[0m\u001b[31mNight shift            \u001b[0m\u001b[31m \u001b[0m\u001b[33m║\u001b[0m\u001b[32m \u001b[0m\u001b[32mDay shift              \u001b[0m\u001b[32m \u001b[0m\u001b[33m║\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m╚══════════════════════════╩═════════════════════════╩═════════════════════════╝\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.174, "o", "\u001b[1;31m╭─\u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m CONTRADICTION REPORTED by Threat Intel Analyst \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m─╮\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;31m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                      \u001b[1;31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;31m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2mORIGINAL ASSESSMENT:\u001b[0m                                                                                                \u001b[1;31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;31m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[37mIR-2024-184 initial attribution assessment: TTPs partially match CC2024-Q3-Opportunistic campaign. Phishing \u001b[0m        \u001b[1;31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;31m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[37minitial access, 9-14 day dwell time, file server staging all consistent. Recommend handling ...\u001b[0m                     \u001b[1;31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;31m│\u001b[0m                                                                                  "]
[0.000, "o", "                                    \u001b[1;31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;31m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[1;31mCONTRADICTION:\u001b[0m                                                                                                      \u001b[1;31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;31m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[37mLooked at the C2 traffic. The beaconing pattern doesn't match CC2024-Q3-Opportunistic. The known campaign uses \u001b[0m     \u001b[1;31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;31m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[37m90-second beacon intervals with jitter; this incident shows no consistent beaconing pattern at all -- the attacker\u001b[0m  \u001b[1;31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;31m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[37mis using interactive sessions rather than implant beacons. Either this is a different attacker reusing some of the\u001b[0m  \u001b[1;31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;31m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[37msame TTPs, or the campaign has evolved its tooling. Either way, don't assume the rest of the campaign's playbook \u001b[0m   \u001b[1;31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;31m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[37mapplies.\u001b[0m                                                                                                            \u001b[1;31m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;31m│\u001b[0m              "]
